(a) Except as provided in subsection (b) of this section, no person may apply any pesticide other than a listed pesticide to any:

(1) lawn;  
(2) playground;  
(3) mulched recreation area;  
(4) children’s facility;  
(5) grounds of a children’s facility; or  
(6) playing field.

